  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "智慧綠台灣",
    "sub_ename": "SMART GREEN TAIWAN",
    "describe_ch": "因應氣候變遷、能源供需失衡等全球危機，應用資通訊溝通與管理技術，即透過環境中各式載體融入智慧化設計，以建構一個投資合理，具有高效、舒適、健康、便利、永續的智慧綠環境，是台灣產官學研各界之共識與本課程意欲建立的價值觀與目標。",
    "describe_eh": " In response to climate change, energy supply and demand imbalances and other global crises, applying information and communication technologies and integrating intelligent designs within a variety of carriers of earth environment in order to construct a reasonable investment, efficient, comfortable, healthy, convenient, and sustainable smart green environment, is the consensus of Taiwan government, and academia circles, and, also the course goals and main values.",
